OL,3,ACivil servant who juggled five jobs
OL,4,Asays he was 'surprised' to be charged
OL,5,Awith fraud
OL,6,
OL,7,FA civil servant accused of fraudulently
OL,8,Fjuggling multiple government jobs says
OL,9,Fhe was ''surprised'' to have been
OL,10,Fcharged with fraud.
OL,12,FKashim Chowdhury told the jury at
OL,13,FSouthwark Crown Court he had not been
OL,14,Fdishonest in failing to tell his
OL,15,Femployers he had other government jobs.
OL,17,F"At that time I was just on auto pilot,
OL,18,FI was like a robot, I was not thinking
OL,19,Fclearly," he said.
