OL,3,ACivil servant who juggled five jobs
OL,4,Asays he was 'surprised' to be charged
OL,5,Awith fraud
OL,6,
OL,7,FChowdhury, 55, from east London, is
OL,8,Faccused of nine counts of fraud. He
OL,9,Fdenies acting dishonestly or intending
OL,10,Fto make a dishonest gain.
